{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world. Earth's monuments are under attack, and only the ingenious sports club and Dr. McLabby can stop the extraterrestrial invaders with enhanced sporting gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slam And Roll lets you capture enemies inside giant sports balls and kick them across the screen</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/f8cc8b06bc8675ed385e568b95db7c5f.poster.avif?t=1768379545\" width=720 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/f8cc8b06bc8675ed385e568b95db7c5f.webm?t=1768379545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...chaining spectacular combos to wipe out everything in your path. Travel from place to place and explore the world\u2019s most iconic monuments through 100+ unique, action-packed stages spread across 8 tour areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters, play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op, and uncover hidden secrets in every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or dive into total mayhem in the Action\u00a0<strong>Roguelike Chaos Mode</strong>, where every run is unpredictable and co-op turns the madness up to top levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why you\u2019ll love it</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless variety: baseball, hockey, basketball, soccer, ping pong, and tennis \u2014 each with unique characters and styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play any way you like: classic hardcore arcade mode or modern adaptive Tour Mode for all skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself: Action Roguelike Chaos mode offers unlimited stage combinations in a rogue-lite experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with unlockable characters, items, bonus stages, and secret stages and area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op fun: defend the world together with a friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic arcade feel with modern polish, online leaderboards, 50 achievements, and Steam Remote Play Together support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Very Different game modes</strong></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/bb81cf451a0db91e31f841baa3d333d1.poster.avif?t=1768379545\" width=720 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/bb81cf451a0db91e31f841baa3d333d1.webm?t=1768379545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool boss fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/341eb258ab9815edb69f240180e7ab5b.poster.avif?t=1768379545\" width=720 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/341eb258ab9815edb69f240180e7ab5b.webm?t=1768379545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crazy mayhem Action Roguelike chaos mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/a15b7cdf36d7289a7ddca7e43c80b1da.poster.avif?t=1768379545\" width=720 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/a15b7cdf36d7289a7ddca7e43c80b1da.webm?t=1768379545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sports\u00a0and</strong>\u00a0<strong>Characters from the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hockey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uli: The master of ice hockey. He also plays on the streets when the weather is too hot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilu: An ice hockey prodigy with lightning-fast reflexes. She\u2019s not afraid of rough matches and loves proving she can outplay anyone on the rink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baseball</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laura: She plays baseball at her school, and she\u2019s pretty good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thonon: A powerful baseball hitter with a calm mind. He rarely misses a swing and always keeps his cool under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Table tennis / ping-pong</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jimmy: A ping-pong master. He can play with two balls at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yanfei: A ping-pong genius with perfect precision. Her quick hands and sharp focus make her almost impossible to beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tennis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marta: She started playing tennis five years ago, and she can throw balls at lightning speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rafa: A tennis all-rounder who never gives up. His endurance is legendary, and he can keep rallies going until his opponents run out of breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soccer (AKA: football in Europe)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rachel: She\u2019s been playing football since she was a toddler, and now she can score several goals per match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hugo: A fast football player. He reads the game well and always knows where to be to score the winning goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basket</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David: Since he was little, he\u2019s been very keen on playing basketball. He learned how to score before learning how to speak English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandra: A basketball star with great control and vision. She dominates the court with smart plays and unstoppable shots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some pictures from the real arcade machines in arcade venues and events</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/0085a1a2bdcb5bb76c53fbebf67cdb25.avif?t=1768379545\" width=610 height=640 /></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Your first perfect stage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/227c84ccff9a141dee67cb8ef912413ee7e42b57.jpg"},{"name":"Stars collector! (50)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/ab0494475d1596919f1862ba9dd1ce2098b14954.jpg"},{"name":"Stars collector! (100)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/7b1d7fe352f3bcfbc27737a5e0f7b545bd3fd914.jpg"},{"name":"Stars collector! (150)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/4c3dfc39dc7a68c3a849f1fc43dd38b6d5de5ea3.jpg"},{"name":"Stars collector! (200)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/f674f12c3bdb1f552ff4a382af075d6b99226636.jpg"},{"name":"Stars collector! (250)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/98b579d85745bc92a3a3164a61477bcf7c638afe.jpg"},{"name":"Stars collector (ALL)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/8c6c5526589aa7f44a5faa75871602beb38a6c1d.jpg"},{"name":"Super combo! (x5)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/97b5671eb0d8c6a00bcd23b02d1d5277f0260e52.jpg"},{"name":"Super combo! (x7)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/0fcccb7fed46c6f9d6151a732c5fa08971aaec7e.jpg"},{"name":"Super combo! (x9)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2004960/91981e659a3c569a97310d8b48f018f8a24095c8.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2004960?t=1768379545","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768379545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/1d9423651542f2058711e49af061f0045662bf65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768379545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/1d9423651542f2058711e49af061f0045662bf65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768379545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>SteamDeck</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KaleidoGames and reviewing players approve this game fully working seamlessly on Steam Deck solid 60FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/6de48eaa7ee941157810e674a102208e.avif?t=1768379545\" width=1280 height=558 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Remote Play Together</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/6a4bbbeb08a65faecca830cce97fef73.avif?t=1768379545\" width=610 height=134 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world. Earth's monuments are under attack, and only the ingenious sports club and Dr. McLabby can stop the extraterrestrial invaders with enhanced sporting gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slam And Roll lets you capture enemies inside giant sports balls and kick them across the screen</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/f8cc8b06bc8675ed385e568b95db7c5f.poster.avif?t=1768379545\" width=720 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/f8cc8b06bc8675ed385e568b95db7c5f.webm?t=1768379545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...chaining spectacular combos to wipe out everything in your path. Travel from place to place and explore the world\u2019s most iconic monuments through 100+ unique, action-packed stages spread across 8 tour areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters, play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op, and uncover hidden secrets in every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or dive into total mayhem in the Action\u00a0<strong>Roguelike Chaos Mode</strong>, where every run is unpredictable and co-op turns the madness up to top levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why you\u2019ll love it</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless variety: baseball, hockey, basketball, soccer, ping pong, and tennis \u2014 each with unique characters and styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play any way you like: classic hardcore arcade mode or modern adaptive Tour Mode for all skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself: Action Roguelike Chaos mode offers unlimited stage combinations in a rogue-lite experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with unlockable characters, items, bonus stages, and secret stages and area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op fun: defend the world together with a friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic arcade feel with modern polish, online leaderboards, 50 achievements, and Steam Remote Play Together support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Very Different game modes</strong></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/bb81cf451a0db91e31f841baa3d333d1.poster.avif?t=1768379545\" width=720 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/bb81cf451a0db91e31f841baa3d333d1.webm?t=1768379545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool boss fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta