genius with perfect precision. Her quick hands and sharp focus make her almost impossible to beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tennis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marta: She started playing tennis five years ago, and she can throw balls at lightning speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rafa: A tennis all-rounder who never gives up. His endurance is legendary, and he can keep rallies going until his opponents run out of breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soccer (AKA: football in Europe)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rachel: She\u2019s been playing football since she was a toddler, and now she can score several goals per match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hugo: A fast football player. He reads the game well and always knows where to be to score the winning goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basket</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David: Since he was little, he\u2019s been very keen on playing basketball. He learned how to score before learning how to speak English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandra: A basketball star with great control and vision. She dominates the court with smart plays and unstoppable shots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some pictures from the real arcade machines in arcade venues and events</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004960/extras/0085a1a2bdcb5bb76c53fbebf67cdb25.avif?t=1768379545\" width=610 height=640 /></span></h2>","developers":["KaleidoGames"],"dlc":[3275740],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste